  "description": "Hurdy-gurdy with maximum buzz and low threshold — the chien attacking every note. Drone at a tritone below for maximum dissonance. Wheel speed moderate so the buzz has time to develop fully. A shadow instrument: the hurdy-gurdy as a droning battle instrument, not a pastoral one. Every note a controlled rattle.",
